# VoiceOps API walkthrough: VS Code "REST Client" or JetBrains HTTP client.
# Start the API first (uvicorn voiceops.main:app, or docker compose up).
# If SUPERVISOR_API_KEY is set, put the same value in @supervisorKey.

@base = http://localhost:8000
@supervisorKey =

### Health: providers, tools, auth mode
GET {{base}}/health

### Start a conversation
# @name conv
POST {{base}}/v1/conversations
Content-Type: application/json

{"language": "tr"}

### 1) High-value dispute: identify + intent in one sentence
POST {{base}}/v1/conversations/{{conv.response.body.id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{"text": "C-1002, TX-50015 işlemine itiraz ediyorum, ben yapmadım"}

### 2) Step-up verification (date of birth; redacted in responses and traces)
POST {{base}}/v1/conversations/{{conv.response.body.id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{"text": "03.09.1975"}

### 3) Caller confirms -> request goes to the supervisor queue (>= 10,000 TL)
POST {{base}}/v1/conversations/{{conv.response.body.id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{"text": "evet onaylıyorum"}

### Supervisor queue
# @name queue
GET {{base}}/v1/approvals
X-API-Key: {{supervisorKey}}

### Approve the first pending request
POST {{base}}/v1/approvals/{{queue.response.body.0.id}}/decision
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{supervisorKey}}

{"decision": "approve", "reviewer": "sup.demo"}

### The caller hears the outcome on the next turn
POST {{base}}/v1/conversations/{{conv.response.body.id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{"text": "Teşekkürler"}

### Safe client retry: send twice, the second one is replayed (Idempotent-Replayed: true)
POST {{base}}/v1/conversations/{{conv.response.body.id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: client-retry-1

{"text": "Talebim ne durumda?"}

### Transcript, state and span traces
GET {{base}}/v1/conversations/{{conv.response.body.id}}

###
GET {{base}}/v1/conversations/{{conv.response.body.id}}/traces

### Fault injection: lose the helpdesk response after commit (next ticket shows attempts=2, replayed=true)
POST {{base}}/v1/demo/faults
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{supervisorKey}}

{"path_prefix": "/helpdesk/tickets", "method": "POST", "mode": "error_after_commit"}

### Fault injection: core banking returns 429 with Retry-After once
POST {{base}}/v1/demo/faults
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{supervisorKey}}

{"path_prefix": "/payments", "status": 429, "retry_after_s": 0.5, "times": 1}

### Active faults
GET {{base}}/v1/demo/faults
X-API-Key: {{supervisorKey}}

### Clear faults
DELETE {{base}}/v1/demo/faults
X-API-Key: {{supervisorKey}}
